  "internal_policy": {
    "END_032": "4mana4/4 Dragon with native Rush and Combo. Only accepted Combo body requests Overload2, then grants original living source Immune(expires_turn=current global turn) and permanent Windfury using same pre-Overload MinionReference. No unconditional intrinsic Overload. Accepted overload remains if original source departs; stale grants do not bind new residence. Native Combo plans/payment/consumption/resource clocks own repeated or cancelled activations.",
    "JAIL_997": "Ordinary required minion spell with explicitly absent SpellSchool. At accepted body current original target, friendly current Demon (including all tribe) gets captured +3/+3 instead; all other legal minions MakeDormant2 via original public lifecycle. Current tribe/control, not printed label, chooses branch; unknown friendly tribe fails explicitly. No invented Shadow school or second dormancy clock.",
    "MEND_305": "Nature required friendly current Beast board target using native TargetPredicateSpec(current_tribes_any=beast). Captured original target +2/+2 first; then native RandomBuffStoredMinion(query beast,tribe_basis=current,HAND,+2/+2) reads current physical hand after preceding reactions. Same-name physical copies each weight1; no hand candidate consumes no RNG. Exact random current tribe basis is not a formal generator pool.",
    "CATA_EVENT_002": "Whole root remains unregistered: actual two-case native repro shows correct trusted IF_AVAILABLE shape but PlayerPort.legal_actions error unsupported_rule before and after real Fireball play. Need a public reconstructible current-turn played-school target input/profile, assigned to coordinator. No full-state/context closure or forged public field workaround.",
    "evidence": "Four full raw rows and eight en-US/zh-CN official full faces retained. Identity/text do not calibrate precise Combo/expiry/dormancy/current-recipient/random windows; formal standard pool and M6 remain incomplete."
  },
